    "body": "Thank you for your good evaluation!!\r\n> Would there be an option to select the colour?\r\n\r\nI added a config to select the highlight colour, `highlight_repo_root_style`\r\n![スクリーンショット 2020-12-12 9 19 49](https://user-images.githubusercontent.com/22494246/101967080-ac94f380-3c5d-11eb-8725-9934f954726a.png)\r\nYou can set highlight colour in configuration file `~/.config/starship.toml`\r\n![スクリーンショット 2020-12-12 9 21 09](https://user-images.githubusercontent.com/22494246/101967115-c20a1d80-3c5d-11eb-9cd0-8e57dae43bcc.png)\r\nand, highlight colour is changed.\r\n![スクリーンショット 2020-12-12 9 21 55](https://user-images.githubusercontent.com/22494246/101967129-ccc4b280-3c5d-11eb-9dcc-044971f658e7.png)",
